# Temperance — cli#282 SECURITY.md address swap

- date: 2026-09-28
- branch: fix/cli-282-security-email-swap
- scope-class: a (small fix)

Right thing: SECURITY.md L8 points at security@bassclef.dev, a mailbox that doesn't exist. npm package page renders the address. Adopters trying to report a vulnerability hit a dead address.
Simplest: one-line edit — security@ → maintainer@bassclef.dev per operator + peer confirmation.
Blast radius: public disclosure surface. Ships as v1.9.7 patch release so npm page updates.
Verification: grep after edit shows only maintainer@; PR CI green.
Reversibility: revert PR.
Drift trigger: expanding to README (already clean), package.json (already clean), or ADR authoring for the alias.
